---

This directory contains a derived copy of the `systematic-debugging` skill from
https://github.com/obra/superpowers (MIT License), with the following
modifications: the locally added "Loop Diagnosis-Handoff Mode" section was
removed; `find-polluter.sh` was renamed to `isolate-polluter.sh` and rewritten
(sequential isolation, fail-closed behavior, pre-existing pollution detection,
space-safe paths, reserved-name guard) with tests added; `SKILL.md` was
restructured (minimal-sufficient-causal-explanation goal, stop-loss exception,
problem-model review, unsourced statistics removed, dead references removed,
env examples redacted); attachments were hardened (boundary-scoped
defense-in-depth, monotonic and cancellable waiting with tests, log redaction,
path-guard hardening). All other files are unmodified copies.
